# Graphify: a code-understanding layer for our development workflow only.
# It is never imported by backend/ and never runs against submitted papers —
# its doc pass produces INFERRED edges, and adjudication here is deterministic.
# GRAPH_REPORT.md is committed so agents can read it without rebuilding.
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
